DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43100::$$$message_0358_0000_0000$$$::"I've found you, Caster. Are you prepared for the consequences?"::
43101::$$$message_0358_0001_0000$$$::"Actually, I don't care. I'm going to show you anyway."::
43102::$$$message_0358_0001_0001$$$::"Oh, she is indeed a bit more feisty than usual..."::
43103::$$$message_0358_0001_0002$$$::"Ugh, we wasted too much time on Archer and the girl..."::
43104::$$$message_0358_0001_0003$$$::"...Emiya. Can you tell us what happened?"::
43105::$$$message_0358_0001_0004$$$::"Y-yeah. Caster kidnapped me the other day...and because of that, Saber..."::
43106::$$$message_0358_0001_0005$$$::"Hm. Our vixen ravished her, did she? How unrestrained for a married woman."::
43107::$$$message_0358_0001_0006$$$::"Th-that's not what happened! [wait canskip=0 time=500][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=哀 layer=1 time=200]I just have all these cute outfits I've been saving up... [wait canskip=0 time=500][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=照 layer=1 time=200][hffeelgood layer=1]So I..."::
43108::$$$message_0358_0001_0007$$$::"She took me hostage so Saber couldn't say no, and had the time of her life treating her like a dress-up doll..."::
43109::$$$message_0358_0001_0008$$$::"There was nothing I could do at the time because you were holding Shirou captive. [l][wait canskip=0 time=300][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=怒 time=200][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HKUZ6_SAV_0040 _name=セイバー]But did you really think I would let this slight go unpunished?"::
43110::$$$message_0358_0001_0009$$$::"W-what's the big deal!? You're so cute, it would've been a waste not to!"::
43111::$$$message_0358_0001_0010$$$::"Hm. I understand now. By the way, Emiya."::
43112::$$$message_0358_0001_0011$$$::"W-what?"::
43113::$$$message_0358_0001_0012$$$::"Be honest with me. When you saw Saber being dressed up, how did that make you feel?"::
43114::$$$message_0358_0001_0013$$$::"The adorable, frilly dresses made me feel joy from the bottom of my heart. No doubt about that."::
43115::$$$message_0358_0001_0014$$$::"...Shirou?"::
43116::$$$message_0358_0001_0015$$$::"Oh, uh, never mind! Yeah, Caster totally did you wrong there."::
43117::$$$message_0358_0001_0016$$$::"Hehe. I see. It looks like I'll have to lecture you overnight... Now it's your turn, Caster."::
43118::$$$message_0358_0001_0017$$$::"...Honestly, this is the very definition of reaping what you sow."::
43119::$$$message_0358_0001_0018$$$::"...Very well. If you are coming at us, then I will not hold back."::
43120::$$$message_0358_0001_0019$$$::"Oh, Souichirou, you're doing this for me...?"::
43121::$$$message_0358_0001_0020$$$::"I'm not so sure about that, Caster."::
e